/// (`NAME_2`, `NAME_3`, … — the same rule [collectRoleSecrets] applies,
/// gh-1781): `buildProviderQueueChain`'s `collectKeyStack` builds a
/// multi-credential `ApiKeyRing` from it for in-entry key rotation.
